   "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Urban and Green Landscapes</title>\n<script type=\"application/json\" id=\"sp-scheme\">\n{\n \"format\": \"sp-scheme-package\",\n \"spScheme\": \"2.0\",\n \"survey\": {\n  \"title\": \"Urban vs Green Landscapes: Restorative Effects\",\n  \"description\": \"Faithful replication of Kang & Kim (2019), Sustainability 11:2129: view 25 natural and built landscape photographs (close and distant views) for 8 seconds each, then rate visual aesthetics, complexity and the five-item short Perceived Restorativeness Scale (1–7).\",\n  \"locale\": \"en\",\n  \"mediaFolders\": [\n   \"scenes\"\n  ],\n  \"pages\": [\n   {\n    \"name\": \"intro\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\",\n      \"name\": \"consent\",\n      \"title\": \"I have read the information above and agree to take part.\",\n      \"isRequired\": true\n     }\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"name\": \"images\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"custom\",\n      \"name\": \"landscape_ratings\",\n      \"title\": \"Please rate the landscape you just saw.\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"description\": \"One trial per image (key nc1 … bd5, labelled as in the paper's Figure A1: NC = natural scene, close view; ND = natural scene, distant view; BC = built scene, close view; BD = built scene, distant view). Each image is first shown alone for 8 seconds, then rated. Value: { aesthetics, complexity, being_away, fascination, coherence, scope, compatibility }, each 1–7. PRS = mean of the five PRS items. Landscape type = first letter of the key (N/B), view distance = second letter (C/D).\",\n      \"items\": [\n       {\n        \"id\": \"aesthetics\",\n        \"text\": \"How visually pleasing is this landscape?\",\n        \"low\": \"Very unpleasing\",\n        \"high\": \"Very pleasing\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"complexity\",\n        \"text\": \"How complicated is this landscape?\",\n        \"low\": \"Very uncomplicated\",\n        \"high\": \"Very complicated\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"being_away\",\n        \"text\": \"That is a place which is away from everyday demands and where I would be able to relax and think about what interests me.\",\n        \"low\": \"Very disagree\",\n        \"high\": \"Very agree\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"fascination\",\n        \"text\": \"That place is fascinating; it is large enough for me to discover and be curious about things.\",\n        \"low\": \"Very disagree\",\n        \"high\": \"Very agree\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"coherence\",\n        \"text\": \"That is a place where the activities and items are ordered and organized.\",\n        \"low\": \"Very disagree\",\n        \"high\": \"Very agree\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"scope\",\n        \"text\": \"That is a place which is very large, with no restrictions to movements; it is a world of its own.\",\n        \"low\": \"Very disagree\",\n        \"high\": \"Very agree\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"compatibility\",\n        \"text\": \"In that place, it is easy to orient and move around so that I could do what I like.\",\n        \"low\": \"Very disagree\",\n        \"high\": \"Very agree\"\n       }\n      ],\n      \"trials\": [\n       {\n        \"id\": \"nc1\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"nc2\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"nc3\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"nc4\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"nc5\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"nc6\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"nc7\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"nd1\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"nd2\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"nd3\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"nd4\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"nd5\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"nd6\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"bc1\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"bc2\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"bc3\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"bc4\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"bc5\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"bc6\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"bc7\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"bd1\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"bd2\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"bd3\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"bd4\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"id\": \"bd5\"\n       }\n      ]\n     }\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"name\": \"about\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"gender\",\n      \"title\": \"Gender\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": 1,\n        \"text\": \"Male\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 2,\n        \"text\": \"Female\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 3,\n        \"text\": \"Other / prefer not to say\"\n       }\n      ]\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"name\": \"age\",\n      \"inputType\": \"number\",\n      \"title\": \"Age (years)\",\n      \"isRequired\": true\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"ethnic_background\",\n      \"title\": \"Ethnic background\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": 1,\n        \"text\": \"Caucasian\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 2,\n        \"text\": \"Asian\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 3,\n        \"text\": \"Middle Eastern\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 4,\n        \"text\": \"Other / prefer not to say\"\n       }\n      ]\n     }\n    ]\n   }\n  ]\n }\n}\n</script>\n<style>\n:root{--bg:#f0f2ee;--card:#fff;--ink:#16231f;--muted:#53645e;--accent:#3d6b35;--accent-ink:#fff;--line:#d2ddd9;--warn:#b3261e}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:16px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,\"Segoe UI\",Roboto,sans-serif}\nmain{max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;padding:20px 16px 40px}\nh1{font-size:1.3rem;margin:0 0 10px}\np{margin:0 0 12px;color:var(--muted)}\n.card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:16px;margin-top:14px}\n.btn{appearance:none;border:0;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 20px;font:inherit;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;background:var(--accent);color:var(--accent-ink)}\n.btn:disabled{opacity:.4;cursor:not-allowed}\n.q{margin-top:16px}.q>b{display:block;margin-bottom:6px;font-weight:600}\nlabel.opt{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;margin-top:6px;cursor:pointer;background:var(--card)}\ninput[type=text]{font:inherit;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;width:100%;max-width:200px;background:#fff;color:var(--ink)}\n.pic{background:#dfe6e3;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}\n.pic img{width:100%;max-height:min(50vh,460px);object-fit:contain;display:block}\n.top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:8px}\n.t{color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n.bar{height:5px;background:var(--line);border-radius:3px;overflow:hidden;flex:1;margin-left:12px;max-width:260px}.bar>i{display:block;height:100%;background:var(--accent)}\n.seg{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(7,1fr);gap:4px}\n.seg label{display:block;cursor:pointer}\n.seg input{position:absolute;opacity:0;pointer-events:none}\n.seg span{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:38px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;font-weight:600;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n.seg input:checked+span{background:var(--accent);border-color:var(--accent);color:#fff}\n.seg input:focus-visible+span{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:2px}\n.anch{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:2px}\n.err{color:var(--warn);margin-top:8px;min-height:1.2em}\n.view{position:relative}.cd{position:absolute;right:10px;top:10px;background:rgba(0,0,0,.6);color:#fff;border-radius:8px;padding:2px 10px;font-weight:600;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n.pic.sm img{max-height:min(30vh,280px)}\n.credit{max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 16px 24px;font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted)}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main id=\"app\" aria-live=\"polite\"><p>Loading…</p></main>\n<footer class=\"credit\">Photographs: Kang &amp; Kim (2019), Sustainability 11:2129, doi:10.3390/su11072129, Figure A1 (CC BY 4.0). Used with credit for research; removed if the authors object.</footer>\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var KEY='kangkim2019:', IDS=[];[['nc',7],['nd',6],['bc',7],['bd',5]].forEach(function(t){for(var i=1;i<=t[1];i++)IDS.push(t[0]+i);});var N=IDS.length,timer=null;\n  var app=document.getElementById('app'), Q={}, files={}, ans={}, done={}, order=[], SPEC=null, ITEMS=[];\n  function esc(s){return String(s==null?'':s).replace(/[&<>\"]/g,function(c){return {'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','\"':'&quot;'}[c];});}\n  function err(m){var e=app.querySelector('.err');if(e){e.textContent=m||'';e.style.visibility='visible';}}\n  function hideErr(){var e=app.querySelector('.err');if(e)e.style.visibility='hidden';}\n  function ok(r){return !(r&&r.ok===false);}\n  function load(k){try{return JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(KEY+k));}catch(e){return null;}}\n  function save(k,v){try{localStorage.setItem(KEY+k,JSON.stringify(v));}catch(e){}}\n  function shuffle(a){a=a.slice();for(var i=a.length-1;i>0;i--){var j=Math.floor(Math.random()*(i+1)),t=a[i];a[i]=a[j];a[j]=t;}return a;}\n  function q(n){return Q[n]||{};}\n  function saveAll(l,b,cb){Promise.all(l.map(function(a){return SPSite.answer(a[0],a[1]);})).then(function(rs){var bad=rs.filter(function(r){return !ok(r);})[0];if(bad){if(b)b.disabled=false;return err(bad.error);}cb();});}\n  function page(html,btn,cb){\n    clearInterval(timer);app.innerHTML=html+'<div style=\"margin-top:18px\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\">'+esc(btn||'Continue')+'</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div>';\n    document.getElementById('go').onclick=cb;app.onchange=hideErr;\n  }\n  function next(){\n    window.scrollTo(0,0);\n    if(!ans.intro)return intro();\n    for(var i=0;i<order.length;i++){if(!done[order[i]])return image(i);}\n    if(!ans.about)return about();\n    finish();\n  }\n  function intro(){\n    if(IDS.some(function(k){return !files[k+'.jpg'];})){app.innerHTML='<h1>Pictures missing</h1><p>Media folder scenes must hold nc1.jpg … bd5.jpg.</p>';return;}\n    page('<h1>Urban and green landscapes</h1><p>You will see 25 photographs of natural and built landscapes, one at a time. Each photograph is shown on its own for 8 seconds: just look at it freely. Then you rate the landscape on seven questions, from 1 to 7, taking as much time as you need. It takes about 20 to 30 minutes. At the end there are three short questions about you. Your answers are anonymous and you can stop at any time.</p>'+\n      '<div class=\"card\"><label class=\"opt\" style=\"margin-top:0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"ok\"> '+esc(q('consent').title)+'</label></div>','Start',function(){\n      if(!document.getElementById('ok').checked)return err('Consent is needed to continue.');\n      var b=this;b.disabled=true;saveAll([['consent',true]],b,function(){ans.intro=true;save('a',ans);next();});\n    });\n  }\n  function image(i){\n    var k=order[i], f=files[k+'.jpg'], n=0, left=8;order.forEach(function(x){if(done[x])n++;});\n    var top='<div class=\"top\"><span class=\"t\">Photograph '+(n+1)+' of '+N+'</span><div class=\"bar\"><i style=\"width:'+(100*n/N)+'%\"></i></div></div>';\n    clearInterval(timer);\n    app.innerHTML=top+'<div class=\"card view\"><div class=\"pic\"><img alt=\"Landscape photograph\" src=\"'+esc(f.url)+'\"></div><span class=\"cd\" id=\"cd\">8</span></div><p style=\"margin-top:10px\">Look at the photograph. The questions appear after 8 seconds.</p>';\n    timer=setInterval(function(){left--;var c=document.getElementById('cd');if(c)c.textContent=left;if(left<=0){clearInterval(timer);rate();}},1000);\n    function rate(){\n      window.scrollTo(0,0);\n      var rows=ITEMS.map(function(it){return '<div class=\"q\"><b>'+esc(it.text)+'</b><div class=\"seg\" role=\"radiogroup\" aria-label=\"'+esc(it.text)+'\">'+[1,2,3,4,5,6,7].map(function(v){return '<label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"'+it.id+'\" value=\"'+v+'\"><span>'+v+'</span></label>';}).join('')+'</div><div class=\"anch\"><span>'+esc(it.low)+'</span><span>'+esc(it.high)+'</span></div></div>';}).join('');\n      page(top+'<div class=\"card\"><div class=\"pic sm\"><img alt=\"Landscape photograph\" src=\"'+esc(f.url)+'\"></div><p style=\"margin-top:12px;color:var(--ink);font-weight:600\">'+esc(q('landscape_ratings').title)+'</p>'+rows+'</div>',n===N-1?'Continue':'Next photograph',function(){\n        var v={};for(var j=0;j<ITEMS.length;j++){var x=app.querySelector('input[name=\"'+ITEMS[j].id+'\"]:checked');if(!x)return err('Please answer every question.');v[ITEMS[j].id]=Number(x.value);}\n        var b=this;b.disabled=true;\n        SPSite.answer('landscape_ratings',v,{key:k,shown:[f.name]}).then(function(r){if(!ok(r)){b.disabled=false;return err(r.error);}done[k]=true;next();});\n      });\n    }\n  }\n  function about(){\n    var ns=['gender','age','ethnic_background'];\n    var h=ns.map(function(n){var d=q(n);if(d.type!=='radiogroup')return '<div class=\"q\"><b>'+esc(d.title)+'</b><input type=\"text\" inputmode=\"numeric\" name=\"'+n+'\"></div>';\n      return '<div class=\"q\"><b>'+esc(d.title)+'</b>'+(d.choices||[]).map(function(c){return '<label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"'+n+'\" value=\"'+esc(c.value)+'\"> '+esc(c.text)+'</label>';}).join('')+'</div>';}).join('');\n    page('<h1>About you</h1><div class=\"card\">'+h+'</div>','Finish',function(){\n      var l=[];for(var i=0;i<ns.length;i++){var n=ns[i];if(n==='age'){var a=Number(app.querySelector('input[name=age]').value.trim());if(!a||a<16||a>110)return err('Please enter your age in years.');l.push(['age',a]);continue;}\n        var x=app.querySelector('input[name=\"'+n+'\"]:checked');if(!x)return err('Please answer: '+q(n).title);l.push([n,Number(x.value)]);}\n      var b=this;b.disabled=true;saveAll(l,b,function(){ans.about=true;save('a',ans);next();});\n    });\n  }\n  function finish(){\n    app.innerHTML='<h1>Thank you!</h1><div class=\"card\"><p>The 25 photographs were taken in Europe and fall into four types: natural scenes seen close up (NC) or from a distance (ND), and built scenes seen close up (BC) or from a distance (BD). In the original eye-tracking study with 31 participants, natural scenes were rated more restorative than built scenes regardless of distance: natural distant views had the highest average restorativeness (4.7 out of 7) and built distant views the lowest (3.9). Photographs rated most pleasing tended to contain many natural elements, and the most pleasing one was mainly water. More pleasing scenes were rated more restorative, while more complex scenes were rated slightly less restorative.</p><p style=\"font-size:.82rem\">Photographs and questions: Kang, Y., &amp; Kim, E. J. (2019). Differences of restorative effects while viewing urban landscapes and green landscapes. Sustainability 11:2129, doi:10.3390/su11072129.</p><p id=\"fin\">Submitting…</p><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    SPSite.complete().then(function(r){if(!ok(r)){err(r.error||'Some answers are missing.');var m=r.missing||[];setTimeout(function(){m.forEach(function(x){if(x==='consent')ans.intro=false;else if(x==='landscape_ratings')done={};else ans.about=false;});save('a',ans);next();},1800);}\n      else{var s=document.getElementById('fin');if(s)s.textContent='Your answers have been saved. You can close this window now.';}});\n  }\n  SPSite.onReady(function(ctx){\n    try{SPEC=JSON.parse(document.getElementById('sp-scheme').textContent).survey;}catch(e){SPEC={pages:[]};}\n    SPEC.pages.forEach(function(p){p.elements.forEach(function(e){var g=SPSite.getQuestion(e.name)||{};Q[e.name]={type:e.type,title:g.title||e.title,isRequired:e.isRequired,choices:(g.choices&&g.choices.length)?g.choices:e.choices};if(e.name==='landscape_ratings')ITEMS=e.items;});});\n    (SPSite.getMedia('scenes')||[]).forEach(function(f){files[f.name]=f;});\n    var o=load('order');if(!o||o.length!==N)o=shuffle(IDS);order=o;save('order',order);\n    var a=(ctx&&ctx.answers)||{};ans=load('a')||{};\n    ((a.landscape_ratings&&a.landscape_ratings.trials)||[]).forEach(function(t){if(t.key)done[t.key]=true;});\n    ans.intro=a.consent===true;ans.about=a.ethnic_background!=null;\n    next();\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
